<title>USA: KeyCorp raises prime rate to 8.50 pct.</title>
<headline>KeyCorp raises prime rate to 8.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>KeyCorp is raising its prime lending rate to 8.50 percent from 8.25 percent effective March 26, the bank said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The move follows a decision by the Federal Reserve to raise the federal funds rate by 25 basis points and to leave the discount rate unchanged.</p>
</text>
